<title>POLAND: BOS TO UP CREDIT, DEPOSIT RATES.</title>
<headline>BOS TO UP CREDIT, DEPOSIT RATES.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Poland's Bank Ochrony Srodowiska SA (BOS) will raise its credit rates by an average of 1.5 percentage points and deposits by one percent on average as of August 12, the bank said on Friday.</p>
<p>The move follows the central bank's increase of its lombard rate by two points to 27 percent and its discount rate by 2.5 points to 24.5 percent last Monday.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
